  "_meta": {
    "status": "draft",
    "note": "Currency -> subunit kind, plus the international name for each kind. The kind is the concept; the word per language lives in data/subunits.json. null means the currency has no subunit (ISO 4217 exponent 0). A currency absent from `kinds` is guessed only when its exponent is 0, which means no subunit; exponents 2 and 3 are not guessed, because they are not a cent or a fils in general (CZK is haler, PLN is grosz). `names` is the fourth resolution tier, used when a language has no word for the kind, so no currency with a known kind reaches the decimal reading."
